00:13:11.079 --> 00:13:12.011
He's excited.

00:13:12.011 --> 00:13:13.678
On the other side...

00:13:15.819 --> 00:13:18.775
The other side, we got Aleks and Lily...

00:13:18.775 --> 00:13:21.073
- For five hours, six hours.

00:13:21.073 --> 00:13:22.429
- It's going to feel like ten.

00:13:22.429 --> 00:13:23.262
- [Evan] Yeah, like ten!

00:13:23.262 --> 00:13:25.334
(Evan laughing)
- Wow!

00:13:25.334 --> 00:13:26.959
- I'm glad I'm on this
side of the airplane.

00:13:26.959 --> 00:13:28.358
I'm glad I'm on this side of the airplane.

00:13:28.358 --> 00:13:33.045
